<title>UK: INSIGHT - Cadbury shares to show resilience.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Cadbury shares to show resilience.</headline>
<text>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    DAY'S RANGE * SUPPORT * RESTNCE* MA-25 * MA-200</p>
<p>Cadbury     520-535   * 520     *   555  * 538   * 507</p>
<p>Schweppes		 *	   *	  *	 *</p>
<p>----------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - April 15 -------</p>
<p>+ Shares in Cadbury Schweppes though not immune to any downturn in the market should show some reslience and be able to withstand some downward pressure better than many other leading stocks, technical analysts said.</p>
<p>+ A drift down to 520p is possible short-term but a bullish golden cross pattern and a descending wedge pattern -- if the latter goes to completion -- imply underlying share strength.</p>
</text>
